@startuml
' ============================================================================
' METADATA
'   author:       TheRobotDrafts Examples
'   description:  Complex SysML distillation activity — mixed continuous/discrete, probabilities, nested invocation, control operators.
'   usecase:      Process plant startup with fault branches, nested sub-activities.
'   complexity:   complex
'   domain:       process-control
' ============================================================================
title Example SysML Activity - Distillation Column Startup

' Probability annotations {p=x} on edges model probabilistic control flow.
' Nested invocation: action invokes another activity (<<callBehavior>>).
' Control operators bracket the continuous phase.

|Supervisory|
:Receive Start Command;
:<<controlOperator>>
EngageSteamSystem;
:<<controlOperator>>
EngageCoolingSystem;

|Preheat|
' Continuous flow — feed temperature stream from instruments
:Stream Feed Temp
  <<continuous>>
  {rate = 50 Hz};
:Stream Column Pressure
  <<continuous>>
  {rate = 20 Hz};

if (Preheat Stable?) then (yes, {p=0.85})
  :Initiate Feed;
  ' Nested activity invocation — PlantUML notes the call; native callBehavior
  :Establish Reflux
    <<callBehavior: RefluxActivity>>;
else (no, {p=0.15})
  :Trigger Alarm;
  :<<controlOperator>>
  ShutdownSteam;
  :Enter Safe State;
  stop
endif

|Column|
' Mixed continuous and discrete flows in the column
:Stream Tray Temperature
  <<continuous>>
  {rate = 100 Hz};
:Sample Product Purity
  <<discrete>>;

:Compute Separation;

if (Purity > Spec?) then (yes, {p=0.92})
  :Route Product to Tank;
else (rework, {p=0.06})
  :Recycle to Feed;
  :Increment Rework Counter;
  ' Discrete feedback edge to Initiate Feed (loop back)
  :Sample Product Purity
    <<discrete>>;
else (off-spec, {p=0.02})
  :Quarantine Batch;
endif

|Supervisory|
:<<controlOperator>>
DisengageSteamSystem;
:<<controlOperator>>
DisengageCoolingSystem;
:<<callBehavior: ShutdownProcedure>>;
:Log Production Run;
stop

note right of Stream Tray Temperature
  <b>«continuous» + rate</b>
  Streaming 100 Hz instrument flow
  entering the discrete control path.
end note

note right of Compute Separation
  <b>Probability edges</b>
  {p=0.92}/{p=0.06}/{p=0.02} model
  uncertain outcomes — a SysML flavor
  beyond plain UML control flow.
end note

note right of EngageSteamSystem
  <b>Boundary controlOperator</b>
  ----
  Surrounds the continuous phase;
  the matching Disable* actions
  at the close-down bracket the run.
end note

@enduml
